    "body": "I'm not sure what's best here.  An implementation actually does need to keep track of IDL object vs ES object here, in general, and knowing when you're working with which is helpful for knowing which actions may or may not have side-effects.  But maybe in this case it's not that big a deal to just implicitly coerce.",
