    "updated_at": "2017-10-13T21:02:22Z",
    "body": "I will close this as personally I am very comfortable with implicit coercion between ES and IDL objects in scenarios like this. (Note: not primitives.)\r\n\r\nIf anyone disagrees, let me know, and I will reopen so we can add something like a note at the top of the [HTMLConstructor] algorithm that we do such implicit coercions.",
